      caption: 'Chain number × strands — ' + SRC[o.src] + ' at N_1 = ' + o.N1 + ', n_1 = ' + f(o.n1) + ' rpm (' + o.sym + ' = ' + f(o.P) + ' hp)',
      note: 'Rule (' + ruleTxt + '). Rows in the galling region C′ or above 9000 ft/min are rejected.' + tail,
